# ============================================================================
# ROUTE 36, expanded  (34x14 blocks, buffer 800/1300; vanilla 24x9)
# Source: build36.py -> route36_base.amap; this file = rough.py --seed 7
#   --p 0.55 --scatter 0.03, then meta.py route36
# ============================================================================
# KEPT: all of vanilla, block for block, split at its forest divide: the
#   National Park gate (W), the trainer-tips path and Suicune's spot, the
#   path north to Route 37, the fruit tree; east of the divide the flower
#   meadow, the road to Violet, the Ruins of Alph gate in its rock ledge,
#   Arthur, Noni, the ranger and the Rock Smash guy.
# ADDED:
#   An 8-col woodland between the halves: a pond, a straight stretch of road
#     (the two 5d tree blocks on it became path) and a ledge over a tall-grass
#     dell (one-way hop south).
#   A 3-row southern band: a second meadow and pond, reached through a gap
#     cut south of the west path (old block 4,8).
#   Two rows north so the Route 37 path runs a little longer; 2 cols east.
# SHIFT for vanilla data: y +4 steps; x +16 steps for vanilla x >= 24.
# NOTE: the Ranger (23,13) plugs the west-half choke as in vanilla; his
#   event flag hides him. amap reports N/sign gated only because of him.
# CONNECTIONS: E row 6 (steps 12-13) -> Violet W exit row 4 (steps 8-9):
#   offset -2. N col 7 (step 14) -> Route 37: was +4, recheck. S edge forest.
# ============================================================================
ref Route36
key g=08 h=09 k=0b D=0c F=0d i=10 j=11 G=1a I=3d O=3e U=5d V=5e X=60 Y=62 Z=64 a=65 t=66 A=6a K=6b N=70
key !=3c ?=3d @=3e $=3f &=64 +=62 |=60 <=5d >=5e %=61 /=5c
grid:
TTTTTTT.TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTTT?,.?,TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTTTTX.S,YTTT,?""!TTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTTUVX...YTT,(^^)?TTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTT,YZ,a,tTT,[~~],*TT"""!UUVTTTTT
TghTSYT,#OV#?,,,,,,$TT,*,*,*,SIUTT
Tijk.YTZaaIU..........,...........
TTTT.YTTTTTX,*,,,"",TTZaS..aaaaaTT
TTTT.,""TT?$@,=====,TTTTTDFTTTTTTT
TTX@......,TT""""""?TTTTTghooTTTTT
TTXT,TTTTTTTTT"""",TTTTToGjANNKTTT
TTT|"""""<(^^^),""+TTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TT?@""""$*[~~~]""",TTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
end
exit E 67 12
exit N 14 0
exit ParkGate 6 12
exit RuinsGate 51 17
